8d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=620e8ef5b557ccddb9929c33908b127c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kubota_keita/works/117", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/03b1d4c9/uploads/origins/15975479-ef67-4583-a47f-d3b859a5e9e9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f60717690ce10c196f04764c7ac37be3", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/03b1d4c9/uploads/origins/15975479-ef67-4583-a47f-d3b859a5e9e9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f60717690ce10c196f04764c7ac37be3, https://si.imgix.net/03b1d4c9/uploads/origins/15975479-ef67-4583-a47f-d3b859a5e9e9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=15652b3e392001d71a379c35598a2eed 2x, https://si.imgix.net/03b1d4c9/uploads/origins/15975479-ef67-4583-a47f-d3b859a5e9e9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d4dfb00f1ea33e8c10ffba869568dee5 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、はじめまして！　TLやSkebで投稿されている絵を拝見して、いつかご依頼したいと考えていました。\nよろしければ、うちの仔たちの絵をお願いできないでしょうか？\n\n【キャラ資料】\n虎の「秋穂」\nhttps://wa-ryu.net/wp/char/akiho/\nhttps://twitter.com/tigrr_/status/1460970487891181576\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/10OLIvjI4LadiJaszi5xGegKeNYZYxPCR?usp=sharing\n\n仔竜の「アルバ」\nhttps://wa-ryu.net/wp/char/arbaa/\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1s1WFV3ekAy5QMDQ-XnTeRsiEuPaN237O?usp=drive_link\n\n【シチュエーション等】\nふたりが景色かなにかを見ながらまったりしている様子を考えています。たとえば花見をしているとか、喫茶店でだべってるとか、展望台のようなところにいるとか……というのが一例ですが、これに限らず、自由に描いていただければ幸いです。\nご検討のほど、何卒よろしくお願いいたします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kubota_keita/works/116", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9a0b38fc/uploads/origins/0f53a0ff-1729-4a9f-8680-c6dbf04c8cbd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ccc03d444866da2906e5e041f3004654", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9a0b38fc/uploads/origins/0f53a0ff-1729-4a9f-8680-c6dbf04c8cbd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ccc03d444866da2906e5e041f3004654, https://si.imgix.net/9a0b38fc/uploads/origins/0f53a0ff-1729-4a9f-8680-c6dbf04c8cbd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7bdf65d5d2036fc7faca5e99d72cfa5a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9a0b38fc/uploads/origins/0f53a0ff-1729-4a9f-8680-c6dbf04c8cbd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b76945c4749706e0f9d5e317ced81af1 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello K太-san! I really love your art and have waited this for a while!\n\nI would like to request an illustration for my white tiger OC. He is a white tiger shikigami who is able to manipulate thunder to strike at his enemies.\n\nCould you draw a kemono (ケモノ) form of him? Composition, expressions, etc. are completely up to you!\n\nFor reference, I really liked this work of yours!\nhttps://skeb.jp/@kubota_keita/works/106\n\nThank you for considering my request!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1XiONVKXZptZq-eWquF_FUJDbc-qL3KGz?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kubota_keita/works/115", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/4d9dbece/uploads/origins/4816bc05-999b-44b6-b871-ee74dae03d76?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0ae0cb92947e01b50dd22064660d0b2f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4d9dbece/uploads/origins/4816bc05-999b-44b6-b871-ee74dae03d76?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0ae0cb92947e01b50dd22064660d0b2f, https://si.imgix.net/4d9dbece/uploads/origins/4816bc05-999b-44b6-b871-ee74dae03d76?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=490f78d858bb7f909f0413e7bf4ad05c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4d9dbece/uploads/origins/4816bc05-999b-44b6-b871-ee74dae03d76?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d1624ac568179a8e16bc58bff63af1d0 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "暗い裏路地背景のグルスガンマモンとクラモン、インプモンX抗体、ギルモンX抗体が出てくる絵が欲しい。グルスガンマモンはしゃがんで座っていたり、壁に背中を傾けていて、悪い感じがよく生きていればと思います。インプモン×抗体はゴミ箱に座っていていつまでも主人公はグルスガンマモンなのでギルモン×抗体は顔の横姿だけ隅に出るくらいお願い致しますです。 글루스 감마몬은 쪼그리고 있거나, 벽에 등을 갖고 있거나, 불량한 느낌이 확실히 하고 있으면 좋네요.임프몬x항체는 쓰레기통에 앉아 있고, 언제까지나 주인공은 그루스 감마몬이므로 길몬x항체는 얼굴의 옆모습만 구석에 나오는 정도에 부탁합니다 쿠라몬은 자유분방에 몇 마리 떠오르거나 붙는 정도로 괜찮습니다", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kubota_keita/works/114", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a2a14a4c/uploads/origins/28364167-24e9-42d4-9eff-d88289b8e042?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=bc2a6923089afee7953409a92357942c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a2a14a4c/uploads/origins/28364167-24e9-42d4-9eff-d88289b8e042?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=bc2a6923089afee7953409a92357942c, https://si.imgix.net/a2a14a4c/uploads/origins/28364167-24e9-42d4-9eff-d88289b8e042?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=a31e16b2d74b6375046fc1a3d03d9e4f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a2a14a4c/uploads/origins/28364167-24e9-42d4-9eff-d88289b8e042?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=bb1cf18e32c23514e98d6ea7191f19e7 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kubota_keita/works/113", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/81d0efb7/uploads/origins/b8177371-0a46-44c1-a